n" [:option {:value "158265"} "Coxed Pairs, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "158275"} "Coxless Fours, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "158290"} "Coxed Fours, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "158302"} "Eights, Men"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "9031206"} "1896"] "\n" [:option {:value "157529"} "1904"] "\n" [:option {:value "157643"} "1920"] "\n" [:option {:value "157679"} "1924"] "\n" [:option {:value "157752"} "1928"] "\n" [:option {:value "157889"} "1932"] "\n" [:option {:value "157941"} "1936"] "\n" [:option {:value "158011"} "1948"] "\n" [:option {:value "158130"} "1952"] "\n" [:option {:value "158322"} "1960"] "\n" [:option {:value "158403"} "1964"] "\n" [:option {:value "158482"} "1968"] "\n" [:option {:value "158562"} "1972"] "\n" [:option {:value "158659"} "1976"] "\n" [:option {:value "158793"} "1980"] "\n" [:option {:value "158914"} "1984"] "\n" [:option {:value "159028"} "1988"] "\n" [:option {:value "159183"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "159368"} "1996"] "\n" [:option {:value "159563"} "2000"] "\n" [:option {:value "159743"} "2004"] "\n" [:option {:value "260980"} "2008"] "\n" [:option {:value "319027"} "2012"] "\n" [:option {:value "353953"} "2016"] "\n" [:option {:value "19008433"} "2020"] "\n" [:option {:value "2012433"} "2024"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/379"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Double Sculls, Men" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "23 – 27 November 1956"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/399"} "Lake Wendouree, Ballarat, Victoria"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/158247"} "16 from 8 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "There were no particularly obvious favorites in the double sculls event at the 1956 Summer Olympics. The reigning European Champions from the Soviet Union, " [:a {:href "/athletes/40215"} "Aleksandr Berkutov"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/40379"} "Yury Tyukalov"] ", were definitely in contention, but so were British brothers " [:a {:href "/athletes/37436"} "Sidney"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/37437"} "Bill Rand"] ", winners of the 1956 Double Sculls Challenge Cup at the Henley Royal Regatta (then the equivalent of a World Championship), and " [:a {:href "/athletes/35507"} "Murray Riley"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/35555"} "Merv Wood"] " of Australia, the reigning British Empire and Commonwealth champions. Finally, the United States, represented in Melbourne by Detroit Boat Club members " [:a {:href "/athletes/40596"} "Pat Costello"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/40668"} "Jim Gardiner"] ", could never be ignored in the double sculls."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The Soviet Union dominated the opening round, while the United States won its heat handily. Australia and the German duo of " [:a {:href "/athletes/37985"} "Thomas Schneider"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/37848"} "Kurt Hipper"] ", who had been runners-up at the most recent European Championships, came out on top in the repêchage and joined the two world superpowers in the final. There, the Germans took an early lead, but were quickly passed by the Americans, who were in turn overtaken by the Soviet Union before the halfway mark. The duo from the USSR never relinquished from that point on and captured gold over eight seconds ahead of the United States, who settled for silver. The Australians, meanwhile, gradually overtook the tiring Germans and secured a bronze medal. Riley and Wood were both police officers at the time, but their futures would take decidedly different paths: Wood went on to become the New South Wales Police Commissioner, but eventually had to step down due to his association with Riley, who served many years in jail for major drug-related offenses."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/40215"} "Aleksandr Berkutov"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/40379"} "Yury Tyukalov"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/40596"} "Pat Costello"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/40668"} "Jim Gardiner"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/35507"} "Murray Riley"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/35555"} "Merv Wood"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUS.png"}] "AUS"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/37985"} "Thomas Schneider"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/37848"} "Kurt Hipper"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2 h1 r2/3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/37436"} "Sidney Rand"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/374